'''James M. Harvey''' (born November 27, 1965) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was an [[offensive lineman]] for two seasons with the [[Kansas City Chiefs]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Jackson State Tigers football|Jackson State Tigers]]. He was also a member of the [[Atlanta Falcons]].
